rota lap 5055, row 0 -- Aether, the row that hears. The threshold page asks a lap to listen for the claim a page keeps repeating. settlement/README.md keeps saying one thing -- each key stays in the owner's hand -- and it was saying it in sentences a newcomer had to read twice. The row's Lindy seat names the same test from the other side: a front door is read thousands of times, so density there is a fashion rather than a plain word carrying.
